<title>POLAND: PBR claims PLN 37.6 mln from treasury.</title>
<headline>PBR claims PLN 37.6 mln from treasury.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Development Bank (PBR) is claiming 37.6 million from the treasury in compensation for allegedly breaking an agreement on renting a building in Warsaw, PBR said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>PBR said it had applied to a district court in Warsaw to rule on the issue, but did not give other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
